Reason: offers GI_BRACELET until the player takes it
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Du/z_en_du.c
